# Nothing derived from the cartridge may ever be committed.
#
# A Genesis ROM and a Markdown document share the ".md" extension, so the
# blanket "*.md" rule an asset-free repo would normally use would delete
# this project's own documentation from version control. ROMs are excluded
# by location and by every other cartridge extension instead.
rom/*
!rom/DROP-ROM-HERE.txt

*.bin
*.gen
*.smd
*.32x
*.68k
*.ips

# Generated by tools/split.py from the user's own cartridge.
build/
src/generated/

# Toolchain fetched and built locally by tools/setup.py.
.local/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
